<h2>Editing this portal</h2>
<p>SOP pages live at <code>src/sop/*.njk</code> in the main repo. Edit, commit, push; Cloudflare deploys in 60 seconds. The portal is excluded from the public sitemap and from Pagefind's index. Anyone with the URL can read it, so I do not include client-identifying info in the open. Use placeholder names (<em>Acme Roofing</em>, <em>Jane Smith</em>) when documenting examples.</p>
